    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/60e2f6bdb97207ade09af745f764fe16.avif?t=1755401797\" width=722 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/70197d9b50e9b9907c08f57134059b8c.poster.avif?t=1755401797\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/70197d9b50e9b9907c08f57134059b8c.webm?t=1755401797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/70197d9b50e9b9907c08f57134059b8c.mp4?t=1755401797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each hand plays according to the standard rules of blackjack, but every hit, stand, or double down matters and creates a series of triggers that helps you beat the odds. Pick your starting suits to fit your playstyle, as each comes with its own perks:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spades cards will grant you additional damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearts cards will recover health during battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clubs cards will increase your luck, helping your to get more favorables draws </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diamonds cards will steal chips from your opponent, allowing you to purchase new cards and trinkets<strong>\u00a0</strong>for the run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/b2901f8da85cfbdf9e57c24f8f741edc.avif?t=1755401797\" width=755 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/57caa32a6ac7445097ace3eb39be712f.poster.avif?t=1755401797\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/57caa32a6ac7445097ace3eb39be712f.webm?t=1755401797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/57caa32a6ac7445097ace3eb39be712f.mp4?t=1755401797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your journey with endless possibilities. Fine-tune your deck to suit your unique playstyle and craft synergies that defy the odds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Starting decks to unlock, each shaping your gameplay from the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your 2 starting suits, with the ability to purchase additional cards of any suits during your run to further customize your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ trinkets to discover, acquired as battle rewards, during events, or purchased at the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different card upgrade effects to empower your cards and gain a decisive edge during battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/2f69e315e7b4fd1cce6d554c6882b73b.avif?t=1755401797\" width=722 height=108 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/3bc6822c7e17544d17611acc53ce0580.poster.avif?t=1755401797\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/3bc6822c7e17544d17611acc53ce0580.webm?t=1755401797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/3bc6822c7e17544d17611acc53ce0580.mp4?t=1755401797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a labyrinth of ever-changing casinos. Each map is procedurally generated, packed with secret events, dealers with rigged decks, and unpredictable challenges. No two runs are the same, ensuring endless replayability and strategic depth:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 difficulty levels, adding an extra layer of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unique events that will alter your run in different ways depending on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different maps, featuring different pit-bosses at the end of each.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opponent's decks and trinkets are randomly generated at the beggining of each run. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/60e2f6bdb97207ade09af745f764fe16.avif?t=1755401797\" width=722 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/70197d9b50e9b9907c08f57134059b8c.poster.avif?t=1755401797\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/70197d9b50e9b9907c08f57134059b8c.webm?t=1755401797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/70197d9b50e9b9907c08f57134059b8c.mp4?t=1755401797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each hand plays according to the standard rules of blackjack, but every hit, stand, or double down matters and creates a series of triggers that helps you beat the odds. Pick your starting suits to fit your playstyle, as each comes with its own perks:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spades cards will grant you additional damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearts cards will recover health during battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clubs cards will increase your luck, helping your to get more favorables draws </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diamonds cards will steal chips from your opponent, allowing you to purchase new cards and trinkets<strong>\u00a0</strong>for the run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/b2901f8da85cfbdf9e57c24f8f741edc.avif?t=1755401797\" width=755 height=111 /></span></p><p c