/steam/apps/3446840/extras/3bc6822c7e17544d17611acc53ce0580.webm?t=1755401797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/3bc6822c7e17544d17611acc53ce0580.mp4?t=1755401797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a labyrinth of ever-changing casinos. Each map is procedurally generated, packed with secret events, dealers with rigged decks, and unpredictable challenges. No two runs are the same, ensuring endless replayability and strategic depth:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 difficulty levels, adding an extra layer of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unique events that will alter your run in different ways depending on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different maps, featuring different pit-bosses at the end of each.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opponent's decks and trinkets are randomly generated at the beggining of each run. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
